    "identifier": "uzumaki-uzumaki-art-5-pronged-seal",
    "description": "<p>An advanced version of the Uzumaki Art: Basic Seal, requiring two Chakra seals layered on top of one another and reinforced with a 5-point seal of your design, made to lock away Chakra for powerful creatures.</p>\n<p>Make a melee ninjutsu attack against a creature within range. On a hit, the target is infused with the 5-Pronged Seal.</p>\n<p>Seal Break. If a creature within 30 feet of you have ranks of Sealed, you can dispel one rank of that creatures Sealed condition to cast another jutsu of your choice targeting the same creature as a Bonus action, with a casting time of 1 Action.</p>",
